3. You must include a copy of this License when you distribute a
   copy of the program. This License must not be published or
   distributed in a modified form.

4. This License does not permit you to deny others their rights
   under this License.

5. Be sure that everyone including yourself knows the terms of
   the License.

Termination

This License becomes ineffective when you fail to comply with
any of its terms.

If you inadvertently fail to comply with the terms of this
License, you may be reinstated on the conditions that any
repercussions of your noncompliance are repaired as far as
practical. We will not enforce any legal rights to expose you
for a nonviolation.

You can remedy your failure to comply by making the necessary
changes and notifying us.

Final Provisions

If you are not written explicitly enough in this License, the
interpretation should happen in a way that grants freedom
for all users of the referred work.

The terms of this License set forth the way in which you may
